---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '@/components/PageHero.astro';
import CallToAction from '@/components/CallToAction.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Fishing vessel conversion | Lasan Marine"
  description="Items to verify when converting a fishing vessel."
  lang="en"
  ><PageHero
    title="Key considerations when converting a fishing vessel"
    description="Technical note · 12.06.2026"
  /><main>
    <article class="section">
      <div class="container prose article">
        <p class="lead">
          A new fishing method changes deck arrangement, equipment, and loading conditions.
        </p><h2>Review the general arrangement</h2><p>
          Equipment for the new operation must follow a practical workflow while preserving safe
          access and working areas.
        </p><h2>Check loading and stability</h2><p>
          Equipment, fishing gear, and catch alter the vessel's center of gravity. Loading
          conditions must be recalculated for stability.
        </p><h2>Update technical documents</h2><p>
          Arrangement, structural reinforcement, related systems, and the stability booklet must be
          updated consistently before classification review.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article><CallToAction
      title="Need advice for your vessel?"
      href="/en/lien-he/"
      label="Contact us"
    />
  </main></BaseLayout
><style>
  .article {
    max-width: 800px;
  }
  .article h2 {
    color: #0b1c4b;
    font-size: 30px;
    margin-top: 40px;
  }
</style>
